OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident at hospitals    
OL,4,Aover flu and Covid                     
OL,6,FNottingham's hospitals have declared a 
OL,7,Fcritical incident over a rise in flu   
OL,8,Fand Covid-19 cases.                    
OL,10,FNottingham University Hospitals (NUH) -
OL,11,Fwhich runs Queen's Medical Centre (QMC)
OL,12,Fand City Hospital - said the "sharp    
OL,13,Fincrease" in cases had led to "pressure
OL,14,Fon staff and long waits for patients", 
OL,15,Fparticularly in the QMC emergency      
OL,16,Fdepartment.                            
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
