OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4       
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident at hospitals    
OL,4,Aover flu and Covid                     
OL,6,FAndrew Hall, NUH chief operating       
OL,7,Fofficer, said the number of admissions 
OL,8,Fhad "surpassed the predicted flu       
OL,9,Ffigures for this time of year and are  
OL,10,Fhigher than we saw this same time last 
OL,11,Fyear".                                 
OL,13,FNUH said it has about 200 patients in  
OL,14,Fits emergency department, with patients
OL,15,Fwaiting in ambulances for up to four   
OL,16,Fhours, while almost 100 people are     
OL,17,Fwaiting for beds on wards.             
